WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.720
Please, thank you and sorry. A few short words that make everyday conversations polite.

2
00:00:10.470 --> 00:00:15.830
Proszę and dziękuję are among the most useful Polish words.

3
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:20.260
Proszę means please when you ask for something.

4
00:00:20.610 --> 00:00:28.530
It also means here you are when you hand something over, and you are welcome when someone thanks you.

5
00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:33.120
Dziękuję means thank you.

6
00:00:34.870 --> 00:00:36.110
Dziękuję.

7
00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.550
Dziękuję.

8
00:00:38.950 --> 00:00:40.830
It means: Thank you.

9
00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:44.100
Dziękuję bardzo.

10
00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.820
Dziękuję bardzo.

11
00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:50.220
It means: Thank you very much.

12
00:00:51.970 --> 00:00:53.010
Proszę.

13
00:00:54.210 --> 00:00:55.250
Proszę.

14
00:00:55.650 --> 00:01:00.250
It means: Please. Here you are. You are welcome.

15
00:01:00.600 --> 00:01:05.920
One word, three uses. The situation tells you which.

16
00:01:07.670 --> 00:01:09.070
Przepraszam.

17
00:01:10.270 --> 00:01:11.670
Przepraszam.

18
00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:15.150
It means: Sorry. Excuse me.

19
00:01:16.900 --> 00:01:17.900
Tak.

20
00:01:19.100 --> 00:01:20.100
Tak.

21
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:22.460
It means: Yes.

22
00:01:24.210 --> 00:01:25.250
Nie.

23
00:01:26.450 --> 00:01:27.490
Nie.

24
00:01:27.890 --> 00:01:30.130
It means: No.

25
00:01:31.880 --> 00:01:33.520
Let's recap.

26
00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:35.110
Dziękuję.

27
00:01:35.710 --> 00:01:37.230
Dziękuję bardzo.

28
00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:38.870
Proszę.

29
00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:40.870
Przepraszam.

30
00:01:41.470 --> 00:01:42.470
Tak.

31
00:01:43.070 --> 00:01:44.110
Nie.

32
00:01:46.110 --> 00:01:50.950
